#* {{RQ:Milton Paradise Regained|book=1|page=6|lines=76–79|passage=His mother then is mortal, but his Sire / He who '''obtains''' the monarchy of Heav'n, / And what will he not do to advance his Son?}}
# {{lb|en|intransitive|especially|philosophy}} To [[exist]] or [[be the case]]; to [[hold true]], be [[in force]]. {{defdate|from 17th c.}}
