# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[notice]] or [[view]], especially [[careful]]ly or with attention to [[detail]].
#: {{ux|en|From this vantage point we can '''observe''' the behavior of the animals in their natural habitat.}}
#: {{ux|en|She got up before dawn to '''observe''' the lunar eclipse.}}
